# Decision Log

This directory contains decision-level records organized by month.

Structure:
- `<YYYY-MM>/`: Monthly directories
- `<YYYY-MM>/<DD>-<seq>-<slug>.md`: Individual decision entries
- `<YYYY-MM>/INDEX.md`: Index of entries for the month

Example:
```
decision_log/
├── 2026-07/
│   ├── INDEX.md
│   ├── 07-01-initial-architecture-decision.md
│   ├── 15-01-authentication-strategy.md
│   └── 15-02-database-choice.md
└── 2026-08/
    ├── INDEX.md
    └── 03-01-api-versioning-policy.md
```

Each entry file contains a single decision with:
- Heading: `## YYYY-MM-DD — Title`
- Body: Decision rationale, impacts, and implementation status

The INDEX.md provides a quick overview of all decisions in that month.
